sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant S as S3 / R2

    B->>A: POST /v1/orgs/:orgId/files/upload-url<br/>{filename, mimeType, sizeBytes, taskId}
    A->>A: validate mime allowlist + size ≤ plan limit
    A->>DB: insert FileObject (status PENDING,<br/>key = orgs/{orgId}/tasks/{taskId}/{uuid})
    A->>S: createPresignedPost (content-length-range,<br/>Content-Type fixed, expires 5 min)
    A-->>B: {fileId, url, fields}
    B->>S: POST file directly (API never touches bytes)
    S-->>B: 204
    B->>A: POST /v1/orgs/:orgId/files/:fileId/complete
    A->>S: HeadObject (exists? size? type?)
    A->>DB: status = READY, AuditLog file.uploaded
    A-->>B: 200 file
    Note over B,S: Download
    B->>A: GET /v1/orgs/:orgId/files/:fileId/download
    A->>A: tenant + permission check
    A-->>B: 302 → presigned GET (60s,<br/>Content-Disposition: attachment)
